### list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user-online/list?pageSize=10

### list search with keyword
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user-online/list?pageSize=10&keyword=bluefrog

### detail
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user-online/detail?id=1

### force-logout
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user-online/force-logout
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-value"
}

### delete
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user-online/delete
content-type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1,2]
}
